    <string name="google_setup_title">⚙️ Google Photos needs one-off setup</string>
    <string name="google_setup_body">Google only lets an app read photos you pick through its Photos Picker, and that needs a Google Cloud OAuth client made by whoever builds Totum. Nothing is sent to Google until it is set up. The exact steps are in docs/features/phone-media.md.</string>
    <string name="google_pick_title">☁️ Pick from Google Photos</string>
    <string name="google_pick_body">Choose photos and videos on Google Photos\' own page. Totum copies just those onto this phone, so they work offline, in the queue and in the viewer.</string>
